# Project skills

Before architecture, first-load, homepage, work/view, images, icons, fonts, or benches: read every `SKILL.md` under `.cursor/skills/` (start with `aspauldingcode-site`). Do not wait for the user to name the skill.

## Improve the skills

When a change proves a new constraint, cost number, engine split (Blink / Gecko / WebKit), or a rejected approach, update the matching skill in the same turn. Facts and verbs. No em dashes. Keep `SKILL.md` short; put tables of numbers in `reference.md`.

Do not invent skills for one-off chat. Do not duplicate `identity.mdc` or `writing.mdc` into a skill.
